{"seq":3,"slug":"agroforestry","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农林复合系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/agroforestry","wordCount":1909,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-可持续农业-农林复合系统\">研究生 可持续农业 — 农林复合系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>农林复合系统（Agroforestry）是在同一土地管理单元上有意识地将木本多年生植物与农作物和/或家畜相结合的土地利用方式，通过生态互补和资源高效利用实现经济、环境和社会效益的协同提升。ICRAF（世界农林复合中心）将农林复合定义为&quot;一门同时研究和推广树木在农业景观中整合应用的科学和实践&quot;。全球约有超过10亿公顷的农地（约43%）在50%以上的冠层覆盖度下开展农业生产，农林复合在热带和亚热带地区的生计保障和生态恢复中发挥着关键作用。</p>\n<p>主要系统类型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>林农复合（Agrosilviculture）</strong>：树木+农作物组合，如林下种植、等高植物篱</li>\n<li><strong>林牧复合（Silvopasture）</strong>：树木+牧草+家畜组合</li>\n<li><strong>林农牧复合（Agrosilvopasture）</strong>：树木+作物+家畜三元组合</li>\n<li><strong>其他系统</strong>：水产农林复合、蜂农林复合、家庭园林</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"农林复合的生态学原理\">农林复合的生态学原理</h3><p>农林复合系统的生态优势源于多个生态学机制的协同作用：</p>\n<p><strong>光能分层利用</strong>：树冠层和林下作物层对光合有效辐射（PAR）的分层截获和利用。在合理设计的系统中，树木截获上层光线，而耐荫作物利用透射和散射光完成光合作用。整个系统的光能利用率可达单一种植的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>养分循环强化</strong>：深根树木能够从深层土壤中吸取养分，通过落叶和细根周转将其归还表层土壤，供浅根作物利用——这被称为&quot;养分泵效应&quot;（Nutrient Pumping）。刺槐（<em>Robinia pseudoacacia</em>）等固氮树种每年可固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> kg N/ha，减少化学氮肥的需求。</p>\n<p><strong>水文调节</strong>：树木冠层截留降雨（减少土壤溅蚀）、根系增加土壤入渗（减少地表径流）、蒸腾作用调节微气候湿度。在坡地农林系统中，水土流失量通常比无树对照减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>微气候调节</strong>：树木的遮荫效应可降低林下温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，减少蒸发散失；防风效应可降低风速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>（取决于防护林结构），减轻作物风害和土壤风蚀。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主要农林复合模式\">主要农林复合模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>结构特征</th>\n<th>适用环境</th>\n<th>经济产出</th>\n<th>代表性案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等高植物篱</td>\n<td>沿等高线种植灌木或小乔木带</td>\n<td>热带/亚热带坡地</td>\n<td>饲料、薪柴</td>\n<td>菲律宾SALT系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间作系统</td>\n<td>树行与作物行间隔排列</td>\n<td>温带/亚热带平原</td>\n<td>果实/木材+粮食</td>\n<td>法国核桃-小麦间作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>林下种植</td>\n<td>在成熟林冠下种植耐荫作物</td>\n<td>热带</td>\n<td>咖啡、可可、胡椒</td>\n<td>印尼荫蔽咖啡园</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>散生树系统</td>\n<td>农田中稀疏保留大树</td>\n<td>半干旱地区</td>\n<td>遮荫、果实、木材</td>\n<td>非洲Faidherbia白蚁树系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>家庭园林</td>\n<td>多层结构的庭院复合种植</td>\n<td>热带农村</td>\n<td>多种蔬果+药材</td>\n<td>印度喀拉拉邦家庭园</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>林牧复合</td>\n<td>牧场中保留/种植树木</td>\n<td>温带/热带</td>\n<td>畜产品+木材</td>\n<td>西班牙Dehesa栎树牧场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>非洲Faidherbia albida系统</strong>是最引人注目的散生树农林案例。这种豆科树种具有独特的&quot;逆向物候&quot;——在旱季保持绿色、在雨季落叶。因此它不与雨季作物竞争光照，同时落叶为作物提供有机质和固定的氮素。研究表明，Faidherbia树冠下的玉米产量比无树区域高出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳汇潜力与气候减缓\">碳汇潜力与气候减缓</h3><p>农林复合系统通过地上和地下生物量碳储存、土壤有机碳积累和减少化石燃料依赖等途径贡献于气候变化减缓：</p>\n<p>全球农林复合系统的碳汇潜力估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{seq} = \\Delta C_{biomass} + \\Delta C_{soil}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C_{biomass}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为地上和地下生物量碳积累，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C_{soil}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为土壤有机碳变化。</p>\n<p>不同农林系统的碳储量差异显著：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>热带林农复合：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>228</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">228</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">228</span></span></span></span></span> t C/ha（取决于树种和树龄）</li>\n<li>温带间作系统：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> t C/ha</li>\n<li>林牧复合：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> t C/ha</li>\n</ul>\n<p>全球农林复合系统的年碳固存潜力估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span> Gt CO₂/年，是基于自然解决方案（NbS）的重要气候减缓途径之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"经济分析与决策工具\">经济分析与决策工具</h3><p>农林复合系统的经济评估需要考虑长时间尺度（树木投资回报期长达10-30年）和多产品产出（木材、果实、非木材林产品、生态服务）：</p>\n<p><strong>净现值（NPV）分析</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NPV = \\sum_{t=0}^{T}\\frac{B_t - C_t}{(1+r)^t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年的收益和成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为折现率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为评估期。由于树木在前几年无产出但需要投入管护，农林系统的NPV对折现率高度敏感——高折现率（反映小农户的短期资金偏好）不利于农林投资决策。</p>\n<p><strong>机会成本分析</strong>：种植树木占用的土地面积不再种植作物，需要计算放弃粮食产出的机会成本。合理的树木种植密度应使树木产品的边际收益大于等于放弃作物产出的边际损失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>分析农林复合系统中树木与作物之间可能存在的竞争关系（光、水、养分），讨论如何通过系统设计将竞争最小化。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为中国南方丘陵红壤区设计一个等高植物篱农林系统方案，明确树种选择、种植配置和预期的水土保持效益。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>利用NPV分析比较核桃-小麦间作和纯小麦种植在20年评估期内的经济收益（需设定合理的产量、价格和折现率假设）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论Faidherbia albida的&quot;逆向物候&quot;特征为什么使其成为理想的农林树种？在哪些方面可以借鉴这一机制设计其他农林系统？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>评估农林复合系统在中国碳交易市场中的参与前景。方法学上如何准确核算农林系统的碳汇量？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>经典教材</strong>：Nair, P.K.R. <em>An Introduction to Agroforestry</em>——农林复合领域的权威教材</li>\n<li><strong>ICRAF资源</strong>：世界农林复合中心（<a href=\"http://www.worldagroforestry.org）的研究报告和政策简报\">www.worldagroforestry.org）的研究报告和政策简报</a></li>\n<li><strong>碳汇研究</strong>：Albrecht &amp; Kandji (2003) &quot;Carbon Sequestration in Tropical Agroforestry Systems&quot; <em>Agriculture, Ecosystems &amp; Environment</em></li>\n<li><strong>中国实践</strong>：了解中国农业科学院和各省林业科学研究院的农林复合试验示范基地</li>\n<li><strong>经济分析</strong>：Hein &amp; Gatzweiler (2006) &quot;The Economic Value of Coffee Agroforestry Systems in Central America&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>农林复合系统通过将树木有机整合到农业生产中，实现了光能分层利用、养分循环强化、水文调节和碳汇增强等多重生态效益。从热带荫蔽咖啡园到温带核桃间作，从非洲散生树系统到中国等高植物篱，丰富多样的农林模式适应着不同的气候、土壤和社会经济条件。理解农林复合的生态学原理、掌握系统设计和经济分析方法、了解碳汇核算和生态服务评估的技术手段，是推动农林复合从传统智慧走向科学管理的关键能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农林复合系统","id":"研究生-可持续农业-农林复合系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"农林复合的生态学原理","id":"农林复合的生态学原理"},{"level":3,"text":"主要农林复合模式","id":"主要农林复合模式"},{"level":3,"text":"碳汇潜力与气候减缓","id":"碳汇潜力与气候减缓"},{"level":3,"text":"经济分析与决策工具","id":"经济分析与决策工具"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生物多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/biodiversity-farming"},"next":{"title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业水资源管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/resource-management/water-management"}}